{"seq":2,"slug":"sensors-and-actuators","title":"传感器与执行器","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/automation/sensors-and-actuators","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sensors-and-measurement","title":"大学自动化 — 传感器与测量原理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/automation/sensors-and-actuators/sensors-and-measurement","wordCount":1684,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"actuators-and-motors","title":"大学自动化 — 执行器与电机驱动","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/automation/sensors-and-actuators/actuators-and-motors","wordCount":1673,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"传感器与执行器\">传感器与执行器</h1><p>如果说控制算法是自动化系统的&quot;大脑&quot;，那么传感器就是它的&quot;感官&quot;，执行器就是它的&quot;肌肉&quot;。再聪明的算法，如果测不准现状、动不了机构，也只是纸上谈兵。</p>\n<p>本章带你认识把物理世界数字化的各类传感器，理解信号是如何采集、调理和转换的，再走到链路的另一端，看电机、阀门这些执行器如何把电信号变回真实的运动与力。</p>\n"}